  <TextContent>k__BackingField: "Little one,\nI have heard from your Grandmother
    that you're taking the reins of the potion making business and I happen to need
    some help, perfect timing! \nSee, one of my precious plants hasn't been doing
    so well lately. She would need a Watering Solution to regain her former vitality,
    care to help it out?\nSincerely,"
